---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---
<DocLayout title="部署 — Autional 文档" description="在生产环境部署 Autional —— Docker Compose、Kubernetes 或裸金属。包含扩缩容指南与基础设施要求。">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">部署</h1>
  <p class="mb-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">使用 Docker Compose、Kubernetes 或自托管裸金属在生产环境部署 Autional。</p>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Docker Compose</h2>
  <pre class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-green-400 p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto mb-6"># See docs.autional.cn/configuration for setup instructions
# Production: use separate infra + services compose files
docker compose -f docker-compose.infra.yml -f docker-compose.monolith.yml up -d</pre>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">配置</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 text-neutral-600">生产环境需要设置的关键环境变量：</p>
  <table class="w-full text-sm mb-6 border-collapse">
    <thead><tr class="border-b border-neutral-200"><th class="text-left font-medium py-2">变量</th><th class="text-left font-medium py-2">说明</th><th class="text-left font-medium py-2">必填</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100"><td class="py-2 font-mono">JWT_SECRET</td><td class="py-2">令牌签名密钥（至少 32 个字符）</td><td class="py-2 text-green-600">是</td></tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100"><td class="py-2 font-mono">PASSWORD_PEPPER</td><td class="py-2">用于密码哈希的 Pepper</td><td class="py-2 text-green-600">是</td></tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100"><td class="py-2 font-mono">INTERNAL_API_KEY</td><td class="py-2">服务间认证</td><td class="py-2 text-green-600">是</td></tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100"><td class="py-2 font-mono">PG_PASSWORD</td><td class="py-2">PostgreSQL 密码</td><td class="py-2 text-green-600">是</td></tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-neutral-100"><td class="py-2 font-mono">REDIS_PASSWORD</td><td class="py-2">Redis 密码</td><td class="py-2 text-green-600">是</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">SSL / TLS</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 text-neutral-600">生产环境请使用 Let's Encrypt 或你自己的 CA。网关 nginx 负责 SSL 终止。参考用的自签名证书见 <code class="bg-neutral-100 px-1 rounded">docker/nginx/certs/</code>。</p>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">监控</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 text-neutral-600">内置 Prometheus + Grafana 仪表盘，用于监控全部 24 个服务；告警路由由 Alertmanager 处理；链路追踪通过 Jaeger 采集 OpenTelemetry 数据。</p>
  <pre class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-green-400 p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto mb-6"># Monitoring stack
docker compose -f docker-compose.monitoring.yml up -d
# Grafana: http://localhost:13000  (admin/admin)</pre>
</DocLayout>
